  (b) the Runtime, in the combined work, serves either as a facility for
      enabling communication among the Independent Modules or as a mechanical
      facilitator for the functionality of an Independent Module, or both;

  (c) each Independent Module complies with any applicable terms conveyed with
      the Runtime, including the notices in Section 7; and

  (d) you comply with the GPL in respect of the Runtime.

For clarity, terms of your choice may be proprietary. This exception exists to
make that permission effective in the presence of static linking, which is how
